@step Create a taxpayer profile non-interactively.
@static aeat config profile create me --quiet --tax-residence-jurisdiction-scope common_regime --entity-type natural_person --tax-id 00000020C --name "Clara" --surnames "Benítez Morales" --activity "limpieza de oficinas" --activity-start-date 2026-01-01
@blocked sandbox-posture Measured exit 2: every page sandbox pre-registers a profile already holding tax id 00000020C, and one taxpayer may hold only one profile, so the create refuses on the injected identity itself.
